              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "samanthacda22"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This sandwich was sensational a new twist on an old favorite! My whole family loved it, even my 4 &amp; 1 year olds. The sprout gave it great texture, these cheeses are a delicous mixture. This is definately a new family favorite!\n * I must say this sandwich is not bland in the least."
