            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Soup Loving Nicole"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made as written for the first sandwich and I too thought it was a little on the bland side. For the 2nd sandwich I tossed the crab in some zesty Italian salad dressing prior to putting it on the sandwich and this bumped up the flavor quite a bit. I loved all of the different textures and colors going on and this is one I would make again. Next time I will add some red onion slices and maybe even some bacon.",
